	<string>OurMynd uses the camera for video in focus rooms.</string>
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Mynd uses your town to find what is happening near you, so the daily motivation can be grounded in your own day rather than nowhere. Only the town name is kept, and your coordinates never leave the phone.</string>
	<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
	<string>OurMynd uses the microphone for voice coaching and focus rooms.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
	<string>OurMynd lets you attach images to posts and your profile.</string>
	<key>NSSpeechRecognitionUsageDescription</key>
	<string>OurMynd turns what you say into text so you can talk to your coach and voice-dump tasks.</string>
